{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922014705_5eb7e255","chunk_index":1,"job_id":"mwjob_8447f85a17afe47f1dddc26c","precondition_digest":"7349d025237003fc2a71649e47dc3f181ea6e6f1b327c41c9a0c64a4929460d8","project_id":"proj_user_8a5a00cb014a","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v6","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db84fad0e1f348fc","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0687d5113cc82a0a","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5f2555c78168de91","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ec775a481341d056"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922014705_5eb7e255","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"方案概要","missing_source_classes":["支持本章节研究实施规则的项目权威资料或职能确认"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"正文依据本项目研究定义中的已确认事实撰写，包括III期确证性研究定位、多中心随机双盲安慰剂对照设计、成人中重度斑块状银屑病人群与入选阈值（年龄≥18岁、病程≥6个月、PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3）、合成试验药A 100 mg每日一次口服连续16周、1:1随机双盲治疗、主要终点第16周PASI 75、关键次要终点sPGA 0或1且改善≥2级与PASI 90、其他次要终点PASI及DLQI变化、安全性终点、筛选期最长4周/双盲治疗期16周/安全性随访期4周、第2/4/8/12/16周治疗期访视与第20周安全性随访、样本量132例（每组66例）及全分析集CMH检验等统计分析策略。医学作者需核对方案编号与版本、终点定义及各访视时间点表述与最终版方案的一致性。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"required","review_reasons":["本节直接设定高影响设计或研究实施决定（方案概要），请逐卡确认。"],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_db84fad0e1f348fc","section_number":"1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ee35aea4568a74aa8b0fdd42","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8054da15ded3d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922014705_5eb7e255","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"研究背景和立项依据","missing_source_classes":["流行病学与疾病负担资料","试验药物非临床与既往临床研究资料（研究者手册）","监管立项依据文件"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需阐述成人中重度斑块状银屑病的疾病负担与未满足需求，并说明合成试验药A开展III期确证性研究的立项依据。现有可核来源仅确认研究题目、适应症、试验药物与确证性研究定位等设计事实，缺少流行病学与疾病负担数据、试验药物非临床及既往临床研究资料和监管立项依据，无法在不臆造的前提下形成实质正文；医学作者需在补齐上述来源后撰写，并核对本章节与已确认研究目的及终点的衔接。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_0687d5113cc82a0a","section_number":"2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ee35aea4568a74aa8b0fdd42","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8054da15ded3d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922014705_5eb7e255","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"疾病背景及治疗现状","missing_source_classes":["流行病学与疾病负担资料","银屑病诊疗指南与标准治疗文献","疾病严重程度量表（PASI、sPGA、DLQI）授权与常模资料"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需覆盖斑块状银屑病的疾病背景、疾病负担、严重程度评估体系及当前系统治疗与光疗现状。现有可核来源仅确认适应症为成人中重度斑块状银屑病，并提供研究中PASI≥12、受累体表面积≥10%、sPGA≥3等评估阈值及PASI和sPGA于基线及第4、8、12、16周评价的安排，缺少用于撰写疾病背景与治疗现状的流行病学、诊疗指南或标准治疗文献，故本章节不生成正文；医学作者需在补齐来源后撰写，并确保与入选标准及终点定义一致。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_5f2555c78168de91","section_number":"2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ee35aea4568a74aa8b0fdd42","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8054da15ded3d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20260922014705_5eb7e255","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"heading":"作用机制及同类药物研究进展","missing_source_classes":["试验药物作用机制与药理学资料（研究者手册）","同类药物临床研究数据与文献","靶点及非临床药效学研究资料"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需阐述合成试验药A的作用机制及其所属药物类别的研究进展。现有可核来源仅确认合成试验药A为小分子口服固体制剂、100 mg每日一次连续16周给药，未提供靶点、药理学通路及同类药物研究数据，同类药物信息亦不得从其他项目材料迁移，故本章节不生成正文；医学作者需在取得试验药物非临床与临床药理学资料及同类药物公开研究数据后撰写，并核对机制描述与药物技术类型的一致性。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_ec775a481341d056","section_number":"2.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:ee35aea4568a74aa8b0fdd42","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:fb714bc3c01de1","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:63ce4061f946ca","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8054da15ded3d2","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8906e921bf8a9f"]}],"source_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_8a5a00cb014a_d2ecb6f405c5f941:full-draft:ee35aea4568a74aa8b0fdd42","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:ee35aea4568a74aa8b0fdd42","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","text_sha256":"a165024e2a90c76ad5d6609c455aecbb4427ac4b4067202b4a269f021a22d1b1"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:revision:8","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_1ded2281210281a3b8a0:r8:3989470f61c21914","source_type":"current_pro